    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d515">

                <pb facs="0584" n="472" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg472"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Minister Sherrill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-06-15"><hi rendition="#italic">June 15,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>For repetiton to the embassy at Petropolis for its action and for your own. The
                    following telegram is sent to-night to the legations at Lima and Quito. Explain
                    it to the minister For foreign affairs in the hope that he will take similar
                    action. [See telegram of this date to Minister Combs.]</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
